WEBVTT

00:07:28.402 --> 00:07:30.196
The third one has to do with problems

00:07:30.196 --> 00:07:33.073
which are really disguised
as opportunities.

00:07:33.616 --> 00:07:36.368
OK, so optimists don’t shun problems.

00:07:37.786 --> 00:07:40.539
Optimism is about embracing problems,

00:07:40.539 --> 00:07:44.084
because it’s problems that make solutions

00:07:44.084 --> 00:07:45.711
and solutions that make problems.

00:07:46.086 --> 00:07:50.382
So I believe that most
of the problems we have today

00:07:50.382 --> 00:07:53.594
are generated by
the solutions of the past.

00:07:53.802 --> 00:07:55.763
And the great one is this climate change.

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:58.641
The solution in the past
was artificial power --

00:07:58.641 --> 00:07:59.642
“Where do we get it?”

00:07:59.642 --> 00:08:01.060
“OK, here it is.”